  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "P-MMEval",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tP-MMEval: A Parallel Multilingual Multitask Benchmark for Consistent Evaluation of LLMs\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tIntroduction\n\t\n\nWe introduce a multilingual benchmark, P-MMEval, covering effective fundamental and capability-specialized datasets. We extend the existing benchmarks, ensuring consistent language coverage across all datasets and providing parallel samples among multiple languages, supporting up to 10 languages from 8 language families (i.e., en, zh, ar, es, ja, ko, th, fr, pt, vi). As a\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qwen/P-MMEval.",
  "alternateName": [
    "Qwen/P-MMEval"
  ],
  "creator": {
